WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.124
Mobile money is fast and useful, and criminals target it every day. Here's how to stay safe.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:12.268
Never tell anyone your PIN: not an agent, not customer care, not a friend.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:17.630
If someone says they sent money by mistake, check your real balance first.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.701
Trust only the official confirmation message from your provider.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.758
If something goes wrong, call your provider's official customer care straight away.

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:39.974
Before you move on, check: Never share your mobile money PIN. Check your real balance before any refund. Confirm the receiver's name before sending. Save your provider's official customer care number.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:44.381
In the next lesson: Securing your phone.
